#!/bin/sh
# 漂移检查：DTO/controller 改了但 OpenAPI/client 没跟着改 → 阻止 push

if ! git rev-parse --verify origin/main >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  exit 0
fi

changed=$(git diff --name-only origin/main HEAD)
src=$(echo "$changed" | grep -E 'apps/api/src/.+\.(dto|controller)\.ts$' || true)
gen=$(echo "$changed" | grep -E 'apps/api/(openapi\.json|client/)' || true)

if [ -n "$src" ] && [ -z "$gen" ]; then
  echo ""
  echo "✗ OpenAPI 漂移：DTO/controller 改动未同步到 generated 产物"
  echo ""
  echo "改动的源文件："
  echo "$src" | sed 's/^/  - /'
  echo ""
  echo "请在本地跑："
  echo "  pnpm gen:openapi && pnpm gen:client"
  echo "然后把 apps/api/openapi.json 和 apps/api/client/ 一起 commit。"
  echo ""
  echo "应急绕过：git push --no-verify（不建议）"
  exit 1
fi
